// lines that only make sense in the first two weeks after you stay (RV21).

== chat
? endgame:early
- I wrote to my brother that you stayed. He wrote back "Good." Underlined. Twice.   #warm
? endgame:early
- I counted the windows again. Twenty-two. I sort of thought there'd be one more now.   #funny
